module innd-criminal-local-rules.local-rules

import core.frcrimp45.{ frcrimp45 }

// The Northern District of Indiana's own criminal periods, counted under
// the criminal rules (FRCrimP 45(a) governs "any local rule"). The local
// criminal rules govern all criminal cases, and the local civil rules
// govern them too except where inconsistent with the criminal rules
// (N.D. Ind. L. Cr. R. 1-1(a), (b)); those civil periods are the civil
// rules' own and stay in lit/innd. The court may suspend or modify any
// local criminal rule in a particular case in the interest of justice
// (L. Cr. R. 1-1(c)). No trigger carries a service method: FRCrimP
// 45(c)'s three added days follow the manner of service, which is not
// modeled here.
//
// Conditions that are not deadlines from an event stay in notes: the
// court may issue a standard order at arraignment setting the trial date,
// discovery and the deadlines for filing and responding to pretrial
// motions (L. Cr. R. 16-1), not vendored; the court will ordinarily rule
// on a motion to quash or limit a grand-jury subpoena before the
// appearance or production date (L. Cr. R. 6-1(d)(3)); a continuance is
// granted only on an ends-of-justice finding or another reason it will not
// violate the Speedy Trial Act, with a proposed entry (L. Cr. R. 47-1);
// sureties (L. Cr. R. 46-1), jury instructions (L. Cr. R. 30-1), related
// cases (L. Cr. R. 13-1), special orders and release of information
// (L. Cr. R. 53-1, 53-2) and forfeiture of collateral (L. Cr. R. 58-1)
// set no period. The 28-day reply after an answer brief in a 28 U.S.C.
// § 2254 or § 2255 case (L. Cr. R. 47-2) and the notices in § 2254
// death-penalty cases (L. Cr. R. 47-3) belong to federal habeas
// (lit/habeas), not to the criminal case, and are not encoded here.
//
// The earlier N.D. Ind. criminal outline's FRCrimP flow and its decisions
// are FRCrimP, Speedy Trial Act or constitutional authority and belong to
// lit/frcrimp; they are removed here: no reporter text is vendored.
/// The appearance or production date of a grand-jury subpoena (N.D. Ind.
/// L. Cr. R. 6-1(d)).
event GrandJurySubpoenaReturnDate()
/// The date set for trial (N.D. Ind. L. Cr. R. 12-1).
event TrialDateSet()

/// N.D. Ind. L. Cr. R. 6-1(d)(2): absent good cause, a motion to quash or
/// to limit a grand-jury subpoena is filed and served on the United States
/// at least seven days before the appearance or production date; a
/// pre-indictment challenge is in writing, filed with the clerk and states
/// the grand-jury number, the date of service and the return date (L. Cr.
/// R. 6-1(d)(1)).
deadline grand-jury-subpoena-challenge: 7.days before GrandJurySubpoenaReturnDate() counted_by frcrimp45 cite "N.D. Ind. L. Cr. R. 6-1(d)"
{
  forum frcrimp
}

/// N.D. Ind. L. Cr. R. 12-1(a): a party using the pretrial authentication
/// procedure serves on opposing parties, at least 30 days before trial, a
/// copy of each exhibit and a statement of intent to authenticate it under
/// Fed. R. Evid. 901 or to lay a Fed. R. Evid. 803(6) foundation.
deadline authentication-notice: 30.days before TrialDateSet() counted_by frcrimp45 cite "N.D. Ind. L. Cr. R. 12-1(a)"
{
  forum frcrimp
}

/// N.D. Ind. L. Cr. R. 12-1(b): if the subdivision (a) procedure is used,
/// an objection to an exhibit's authenticity or foundation is waived
/// unless an opposing party files it at least 14 days before trial.
deadline authentication-objection: 14.days before TrialDateSet() counted_by frcrimp45 cite "N.D. Ind. L. Cr. R. 12-1(b)"
{
  forum frcrimp
}

test "grand jury subpoena challenge: 7 days before the trigger" cite "N.D. Ind. L. Cr. R. 6-1(d)"
{
  given GrandJurySubpoenaReturnDate() on 2027-03-01
  expect deadline(grand-jury-subpoena-challenge) == 2027-02-22
}

test "authentication notice: 30 days before the trigger" cite "N.D. Ind. L. Cr. R. 12-1(a)"
{
  given TrialDateSet() on 2027-03-03
  expect deadline(authentication-notice) == 2027-02-01
}

test "authentication objection: 14 days before the trigger" cite "N.D. Ind. L. Cr. R. 12-1(b)"
{
  given TrialDateSet() on 2027-03-02
  expect deadline(authentication-objection) == 2027-02-16
}
